avs-cd N/BattleDuel
stack >NIL: 65536
IF NOT EXISTS WHDSaves:BattleDuel
  makedir WHDSaves:BattleDuel
ENDIF
IF NOT EXISTS WHDSaves:BattleDuel/Settings
  makedir WHDSaves:BattleDuel/Settings
ENDIF
IF NOT EXISTS WHDSaves:BattleDuel/Settings/Default.set
  copy Settings/Default.set WHDSaves:BattleDuel/Settings/Default.set QUIET
ENDIF
assign BDSAVE: WHDSaves:BattleDuel
BattleDuel >NIL:
assign BDSAVE: REMOVE
